        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg flex-shrink-0">2</div>
        <div>
          <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Map Your Workflow</p>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm">Complete the sentence: When [trigger] happens, create/send [document]. If completed, next step is [action]. If not completed after [days], [follow-up] should happen.</p>
