        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg flex-shrink-0">3</div>
        <div>
          <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Decide on Draft vs Direct Send</p>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm">Choose whether the workflow should create a draft for review or send directly.</p>
        </div>
